WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.600
Edwin is an AI voice agent that makes phone calls so I don't have to.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.400
You tell Claude what you need. It writes a short brief and waits for your OK before it dials.

3
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:22.800
Vapi runs the call: Soniox hears, Claude Haiku 5.5 decides what to say, ElevenLabs speaks. The call goes out from a Telnyx number.

4
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:34.800
Edwin says it's an AI, then works through the brief. It also handles voicemail, call screeners and phone menus.

5
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:42.400
If it gets stuck or they ask for you, it rings your cell and hands the call over. That part is built but still being tested.

6
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:50.400
Afterwards Claude reads back the transcript. An n8n workflow for emailing the report and adding the booking to the calendar is built too, not yet tested live.
